              "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/suttacentral/bilara-data/published/root/pli/ms/sutta/dn/dn16_root-pli-ms.json",
              "segment": "dn16:2.23.4",
              "pali_excerpt": "“na kho metaṁ patirūpaṁ, yvāhaṁ anāmantetvā upaṭṭhāke anapaloketvā bhikkhusaṅghaṁ parinibbāyeyyaṁ."
